    "body": "Implementation plan v1 (owner-authorized intake/completion): add a focused operation/top_stock diagnostic module, wired after generation for upright mill 2D/3D paths. Read the declared stock facets clipped to the actual controlled region; reuse the existing lazy same-setup prior grid so earlier facing/pocketing removes false warnings. Carry the advisory in existing path notes and show it as a warning in the operation status banner, avoiding a new serialized warning variant/file-format change. Existing move-level collision warnings and post refusal remain unchanged. Tests: named Top/stock heights, equal/high Top, local/nonoverlapping stock, full/partial prior removal, unsafe post remains blocked and faced path stays clean, UI display. Parent implements; isolated leaf documentation and native-gate/static-review support verify the frozen candidate. No new language/framework/dependencies, NC transfer, release or merge. Main base a859847; open PRs touching generate.rs are independent arms/logging, not dependencies. gh-issues skill and graphify executable are unavailable here; using the installed GitHub workflow and current source/tests, no graph generation claimed.",
